When the user clicks **Confirm order**, `MessageProcessor` resolves `context` bindings against the surface `DataModel` and passes the `action` message to `sendToAgent`:

[v1.0 renderer\_to\_agent.json](/specification/v1.0/schemas/#renderer_to_agent.json "v1.0 Renderer-to-Agent Message Schema") [v0.9.1 client\_to\_server.json](/specification/v0.9.1/schemas/#client_to_server.json "v0.9.1 Client-to-Server Message Schema") 

